{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/extras/f5c429002a0b472254267ce84f85dc38.avif?t=1774529929\" width=334 height=170 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/extras/38eb2da0210e75747297456e64c466cc.avif?t=1774529929\" width=1200 height=84 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mhystaria: Awakening of the Forgotten Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mhystaria is a legendary island that emerges from the depths only once every few centuries. The <strong>Guild of Explorers</strong> has entrusted you with a critical mission: you and your team must disembark and investigate its mysteries before the island disappears beneath the waves once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your way to explore</strong> Whether you are an apprentice or a survival veteran, Mhystaria adapts to your style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Mode:</strong> Ideal for taking your first steps, learning the mechanics, and following a structured path guided by the Guild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode:</strong> For those seeking the ultimate challenge. A free, difficult, and high-stakes experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique 2.5D perspective</strong> Feel the depth of a pixel art world like never before. Thanks to a technique inspired by <strong>&quot;Mode 7&quot;</strong>, you can rotate the camera and zoom with total freedom, adding a new tactical dimension to exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op:</strong> Play solo or form a team of up to 4 explorers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management &amp; Action:</strong> Gather resources, manage your inventory, and prepare for the dangers lurking around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized Performance:</strong> A lightweight and low-spec friendly game, designed to run smoothly on any setup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Note:</strong> Mhystaria is a living project. By joining this expedition, you will help us shape the future of the game with your feedback in upcoming updates.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788870?t=1774529929","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3788870?t=1774529929","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/5664c7e58cdac3ff5c600ad55b943e3b2fc819ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774529929","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/5664c7e58cdac3ff5c600ad55b943e3b2fc819ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774529929","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/extras/f5c429002a0b472254267ce84f85dc38.avif?t=1774529929\" width=334 height=170 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3788870/extras/38eb2da0210e75747297456e64c466cc.avif?t=1774529929\" width=1200 height=84 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mhystaria: Awakening of the Forgotten Island</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mhystaria is a legendary island that emerges from the depths only once every few centuries. The <strong>Guild of Explorers</strong> has entrusted you with a critical mission: you and your team must disembark and investigate its mysteries before the island disappears beneath the waves once again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your way to explore</strong> Whether you are an apprentice or a survival veteran, Mhystaria adapts to your style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission Mode:</strong> Ideal for taking your first steps, learning the mechanics, and following a structured path guided by the Guild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Mode:</strong> For those seeking the ultimate challenge. A free, difficult, and high-stakes experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A unique 2.5D perspective</strong> Feel the depth of a pixel art world like never before. Thanks to a technique inspired by <strong>&quot;Mode 7&quot;</strong>, you can rotate the camera and zoom with total freedom, adding a new tactical dimension to exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op:</strong> Play solo or form a team of up to 4 explorers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Management &amp; Action:</strong> Gather resources, manage your inventory, and prepare for the dangers lurking around every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optimized Performance:</strong> A lightweight and low-spec friendly game, designed to run smoothly on any setup.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Note:</strong> Mhystaria is a living project. By joining this expedition, you will help us shape the future of the game with your feedback in upcoming updates.</p>","developers":["Nowysoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"de